text:
可以按下面方式扩展，保持 Feature 和 WebSocket 基本不动，只增强 `core_audio` 内部能力。

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Feature[同传 Controller] --> Managed[Managed Audio Engine]
    Managed --> Adaptive[Default Audio Engine]
    Adaptive --> Observer[A2DP 状态观察]
    Adaptive --> Mic[手机麦克风]
    Adaptive --> Player[FlutterSound PCM]
    Adaptive --> Session[AudioSession]

    Observer -->|A2DP Connected| Media[Media / A2DP]
    Observer -->|A2DP Disconnected| AEC[Communication / 手机扬声器 AEC]
```

### 1. 增加路由策略

```dart
enum InterpretationAudioRoutingPolicy {
  fixedMedia,
  fixedCommunication,

  /// A2DP 可用时走眼镜媒体输出，否则走手机扬声器 AEC。
  adaptiveA2dpOrPhoneAec,
}
```

保留现有 profile，它只表达当前生效模式：

```dart
enum InterpretationAudioProfile {
  androidMediaSpeaker,
  androidCommunicationSpeakerAec,
}
```

对应关系：

```dart
InterpretationAudioRoutingPolicy get routingPolicy {
  return switch (this) {
    InterpretationAudioPurpose.appLlm =>
      InterpretationAudioRoutingPolicy.fixedMedia,
    InterpretationAudioPurpose.turnBasedTranslation =>
      InterpretationAudioRoutingPolicy.fixedMedia,
    InterpretationAudioPurpose.voiceMemo =>
      InterpretationAudioRoutingPolicy.fixedMedia,
    InterpretationAudioPurpose.simultaneousInterpretation =>
      InterpretationAudioRoutingPolicy.adaptiveA2dpOrPhoneAec,
  };
}
```

### 2. 引擎持有有效状态

```dart
class DefaultInterpretationAudioEngine {
  DefaultInterpretationAudioEngine({
    required this.routingPolicy,
  });

  final InterpretationAudioRoutingPolicy routingPolicy;

  InterpretationAudioProfile? _effectiveProfile;
  Future<void> _routeTransitionTail = Future.value();
  int _routeGeneration = 0;

  InterpretationAudioProfile get effectiveProfile =>
      _effectiveProfile ??
      InterpretationAudioProfile.androidCommunicationSpeakerAec;
}
```

`start()` 时读取一次系统 A2DP：

```dart
Future<void> start() async {
  final a2dpAvailable = await _routeObserver.isA2dpAvailable();

  final initialProfile = _resolveProfile(a2dpAvailable);
  _effectiveProfile = initialProfile;

  await _session.configureAndActivate(initialProfile);
  await _mic.start();
  await _tts.start();

  _routeObserver.start(_handleA2dpChanged);
}
```

### 3. 串行处理运行时切换

```dart
void _handleA2dpChanged(bool available) {
  final target = _resolveProfile(available);
  final generation = ++_routeGeneration;

  _routeTransitionTail = _routeTransitionTail.then(
    (_) => _transitionRoute(target, generation),
  );
}
```

```dart
Future<void> _transitionRoute(
  InterpretationAudioProfile target,
  int generation,
) async {
  if (target == _effectiveProfile) return;

  final previous = _effectiveProfile;

  await _tts.suspendForRouteChange();

  if (generation != _routeGeneration) return;

  try {
    await _session.transitionTo(target);

    if (generation != _routeGeneration) return;

    _effectiveProfile = target;
    await _tts.resumeAfterRouteChange();
  } catch (error) {
    await _session.transitionTo(
      InterpretationAudioProfile.androidCommunicationSpeakerAec,
    );
    _effectiveProfile =
        InterpretationAudioProfile.androidCommunicationSpeakerAec;
    await _tts.resumeAfterRouteChange();
    rethrow;
  }

  _logRouteTransition(previous, target);
}
```

### 4. AudioSession 只切换模式

```dart
Future<void> transitionTo(InterpretationAudioProfile target) async {
  if (target == _profile) return;

  if (target == InterpretationAudioProfile.androidMediaSpeaker) {
    await _leaveCommunicationMode();
    await _configureMediaSession();
  } else {
    await _configureCommunicationSession();
    await _enterPhoneSpeakerAec();
  }

  _profile = target;
}
```

手机 AEC 模式必须明确禁止 SCO：

```dart
Future<void> _enterPhoneSpeakerAec() async {
  await manager.clearCommunicationDevice();
  await manager.stopBluetoothSco();
  await manager.setMode(AndroidAudioHardwareMode.inCommunication);
  await manager.setSpeakerphoneOn(true);
}
```

### 5. 播放器保留 PCM 队列

不能调用当前会清空数据的 `resetTtsOutput()`，需要两个内部方法：

```dart
Future<void> suspendForRouteChange() async {
  _suspended = true;
  await _stopStreamPreservingQueue();
}

Future<void> resumeAfterRouteChange() async {
  _suspended = false;
  if (_queue.isNotEmpty) {
    await _ensureStreamStarted();
    _scheduleDrain();
  }
}
```

`push()` 在切换期间只入队：

```dart
Future<void> push(Uint8List pcm) async {
  _queue.add(pcm);

  if (_suspended) return;

  await _ensureStreamStarted();
  _scheduleDrain();
}
```

队列需要限制时间或字节数，例如最多保留两秒 PCM，超出后丢弃最旧数据，防止路由恢复后播放过时译文。

### 6. A2DP 观察边界

只使用系统音频设备：

```dart
bool hasA2dp(Set<AudioDevice> devices) {
  return devices.any(
    (device) =>
        device.isOutput &&
        device.type == AudioDeviceType.bluetoothA2dp,
  );
}
```

不要使用：

```text
BLE Ready
Bonded
vendorProtocol Connected
佩戴状态
HFP Connected
```

这些都不能证明 Media AudioTrack 当前可以使用 A2DP。

最终代码改动主要落在：

- [interpretation_audio_providers.dart](/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_audio/lib/src/provider/interpretation_audio_providers.dart)
- [default_interpretation_audio_engine.dart](/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_audio/lib/src/impl/default_interpretation_audio_engine.dart)
- [interpretation_audio_session.dart](/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_audio/lib/src/service/interpretation_audio_session.dart)
- [flutter_sound_tts_output.dart](/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_audio/lib/src/impl/flutter_sound_tts_output.dart)

